WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:04,160
There was a sudden wave of huge losses on the Bi family side.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,660
has lost half of the offensive force.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,960
It is the Milky Way base that Lu Qin personally guards.

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,460
How come Lu Qin has lost contact now? It’s not just him.

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,760
The entire galaxy base has been lost.

6
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,960
I'm going to the boss of the Galaxy Base

7
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,160
This is also a critical moment

8
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,560
The loss will break through Qingjiao District at any time and spread to the whole city.

9
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,860
We have to start all over again

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,650
I'll take ten people with me

11
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,720
Everyone else stayed where they were

12
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:28,520
Call on Alliance members near the Galaxy Base to rush for reinforcements

13
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:37,000
No one evacuated
